    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT clears stored output.</li>
      <li>OUTPUT emits the stored output. UPDATE applies the discrete low-pass update.</li>
      <li>If cutoff is not positive, the output follows the input.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y_k = y_{k-1} + \alpha\,(u_k - y_{k-1})</latex>
